---@field relativeImpact? aws.frauddetector.string The event variable's relative impact in terms of magnitude on the prediction scores. The relative impact values consist of a numerical rating (0-5, 5 being the highest) and direction (increased/decreased) impact of the fraud risk.
---@field logOddsImpact? aws.frauddetector.float The raw, uninterpreted value represented as log-odds of the fraud. These values are usually between -10 to +10, but range from - infinity to + infinity.

---The variable importance metrics details.
---@class aws.frauddetector.VariableImportanceMetrics
---@field logOddsMetrics? aws.frauddetector.ListOfLogOddsMetrics List of variable metrics.

